        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denzel Washington, David Hewlett, Herman Boone, William Phillips\n- Films and TV: Remember the Titans, Treed Murray, Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, Stargate Universe\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer, voice actor, football coach\n- Organizations and Places: T. C. Williams High School\n\nFacts:\n- Herman Boone was born on October 28, 1935, and he became an American high school football coach.\n- Denzel Washington was born on December 28, 1954, and he is an American actor, director, and producer.\n- David Hewlett was born on April 18, 1968, and he is an English-born Canadian actor, writer, director, and voice actor.\n- In 1971, Herman Boone coached the T. C. Williams High School football team to a 13-0 season, a state championship, and a national championship runner-up finish.\n- In 2000, the film Remember the Titans portrayed Herman Boone, and Denzel Washington played Boone in that film.\n- In 2001, Treed Murray, also known as Get Down, was released as a Canadian drama thriller written and directed by William Phillips and starring David Hewlett.\n- David Hewlett is best known for playing Dr. Rodney McKay on the Canadian-American science fiction television shows Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, and Stargate Universe.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
